    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/travel-booking-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Travel Booking Agency is a feature-packed, responsive, and SEO-optimized theme crafted for travel agencies, tour operators, and online booking platforms that want to simplify reservations and enhance customer experience through tools like trip booking systems, holiday planners, tour package builders, itinerary management, booking calendars, real-time travel deals, and destination showcase layouts. Ideal for promoting holiday packages, group tours, adventure travel, destination management services, luxury vacations, eco-tourism, honeymoon trips, and customized itineraries, this theme delivers advanced booking functionality for smooth and efficient trip planning. Integrated with powerful plugins such as Travel Engine for tour and trip management and Contact Form 7 for customer inquiries, it supports real-time availability for flights, hotels, car rentals, cruises, and tour bookings, ensuring a secure and seamless reservation process. Its visually engaging design helps showcase destinations, travel guides, itineraries, and package details clearly, while the mobile-friendly and cross-browser-compatible structure guarantees consistent performance across all devices. With features like interactive itineraries, multiple payment gateway support, translation readiness, and flexible customization options, Travel Booking Agency provides a professional, conversion-focused foundation for building a reliable and scalable online travel portal. Demo: https://preview.themescaliber.com/travel-booking-agency-pro/"
    },
